<view class="page">
  <view class="sub-nav"><text bindtap="back">‹</text><text>服务技师</text><text/></view>
  <view class="topbar"><view><text class="top-title">服务技师</text><text class="top-subtitle">真实排班 · 安心选择</text></view><button open-type="contact" show-message-card session-from="therapists">客服</button></view>
  <view class="hero">
    <view><text class="hero-kicker">ZHONGYUAN CARE</text><text class="hero-title">专业守护每一次放松</text><text class="hero-copy">仅展示未来两日真实可预约人员，不使用虚构姓名、照片、评分或订单量</text></view>
    <view class="hero-seal"><text>中原</text><text>甄选</text></view>
  </view>
  <scroll-view scroll-x class="filters" show-scrollbar="{{false}}"><view class="filter-row"><text wx:for="{{filters}}" wx:key="key" class="filter {{activeFilter === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectFilter">{{item.label}}</text></view></scroll-view>
  <view class="sort-row"><text>排序</text><button wx:for="{{sorts}}" wx:key="key" class="{{activeSort===item.key?'active':''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectSort">{{item.label}}</button></view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="state-card"><view class="loading-ring"/><text>正在读取真实排班…</text></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="state-card error-card"><text>{{error}}</text><button bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view>
  <view wx:elif="{{!visibleTherapists.length}}" class="state-card empty-card"><text class="empty-symbol">◇</text><text>当前筛选暂无真实可约技师</text><text>只展示后台已审核资料；技师未排班时不会开放下单</text></view>

  <view wx:else class="therapist-list">
    <view wx:for="{{visibleTherapists}}" wx:key="id" class="therapist-card {{item.bookable ? '' : 'disabled'}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openDetail">
      <view class="avatar-wrap tone-{{item.avatarIndex}}"><image wx:if="{{item.avatarUrl}}" src="{{item.avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><block wx:else><view class="avatar-head"/><view class="avatar-body"/></block><text>{{item.badge}}</text><view class="status-dot {{item.statusTone}}"/></view>
      <view class="card-content">
        <view class="name-row"><text class="name">{{item.alias}}</text><text class="status {{item.statusTone}}">{{item.statusLabel}}</text></view>
        <view class="tag-row"><text wx:for="{{item.tags}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view>
        <view class="data-row"><text>{{item.ratingLabel}}</text><text>·</text><text>{{item.orderCountLabel}}</text></view>
        <view class="time-row"><text>最早可约</text><text>{{item.earliestLabel}}</text></view>
        <text class="travel">{{item.travelLabel}}</text>
      </view>
      <button class="book-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" catchtap="openBooking" disabled="{{!item.bookable}}">去下单</button>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="disclosure"><text>资料说明</text><text>姓名、头像、介绍、评价与履约数据均来自同一后台公开档案；未经本人及平台审核的字段不会展示。所有技师均免出行费。</text></view>
  <view class="safe-bottom" />

  <view wx:if="{{bookingOpen}}" class="sheet-mask" bindtap="closeBooking">
    <view class="booking-sheet" catchtap="keepBookingOpen">
      <view class="sheet-handle"/>
      <view class="sheet-head"><view><text>选择服务项目</text><text>{{selectedTherapist.alias}} · {{selectedTherapist.earliestLabel}}</text></view><text bindtap="closeBooking">×</text></view>
      <view class="service-option" wx:for="{{selectedTherapist.services}}" wx:key="id" data-slug="{{item.slug}}" bindtap="chooseService">
        <view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.subtitle}}</text><view><text>{{item.durationMinutes}}分钟</text><text>{{item.slots.length}}个可约时段</text></view></view>
        <view class="service-price"><text>¥</text><text>{{item.price}}</text><text>›</text></view>
      </view>
      <text class="sheet-note">进入确认页后选择具体时间、填写服务地址并查看最终价格明细</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
